  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v1.0.8 -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\nThis release adds more media types to the favorites and search pages! There are also many bug fixes.\r\n\r\n### New Features & Enhancements\r\n* Add more searchable types & choose what to search in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1857\r\n* Update favorites page with more types in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1864\r\n* Add controls to edit playlists in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1927\r\n### UI/UX Improvements\r\n* Add button to navigate to random item in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1916\r\n* Add wrap around scrolling to settings pages in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1937\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n* Fix white flash on app start in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1909\r\n* Fix image loading issues related to VPN and/or Fire OS 6 in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1910\r\n* Fixes to default home view options for music & videos in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1926\r\n* Fixes to Now Playing page in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1915\r\n* Fixes to season/episode search with duplicates in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1946\r\n* Configure playback controls for RTL in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1945\r\n* Fix person credits: movie release dates, full filmography, sorted order by @SergeiAK in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1950\r\n* Fixes to `v1.0.7` in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1953\r\n* Fix OS screensaver starting during playback with dim enabled in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1956\r\n* Fix favorites not querying for people & fix restoring focus on search page for discover items in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1961\r\n### Other changes\r\n* Update API level to Android 17 in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1908\r\n* Localized formatting for season and episode display by @tal-sarid in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1884\r\n* Consolidate sending media reports & app logs in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1936\r\n* Update dependencies in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1952\r\n* Increase memory for CI builds in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1954\r\n* Translations 2026-09-12 in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1957\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @SergeiAK made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1950\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/compare/v1.0.7...v1.0.8",
